Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian god card is\Nno match for mine, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your obelisk may be more powerful than my\Nslifer right now, but that can all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.61,0:01:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your monster crosses paths with the\Nmighty fist of Obelisk the Tormenter,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I haven't missed\Nall the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and Yugi both have\NEgyptian god cards on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.55,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's high-five!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Those must be Egyptian god cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard they're the strongest\Ncreatures in Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:01:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sailed around the world\Nand never seen such beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sending a chopper for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking you to a real hospital now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.07,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't those two of\Nthe three Egyptian god cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, and it looks like\Nthey're about to brawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope Yu-Gi's is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let the chaos\Nand destruction begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to send Slifer the\NSky Dragon to the graveyard, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, you were\Nonly holding two cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:03:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,which means Slifer only has 2,000\Nattack points, half of what Obelisk has.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your so-called Egyptian God\Ncard is powerless against mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to have overlooked Slifer\Nthe Sky Dragon's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,as my Egyptian God card weakens yours with\Nthe incredible power of its second mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate your special ability now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, you'll think twice about\Nsummoning a monster in Slyfer's presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what was that you were saying about your\NEgyptian god card being stronger than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monsters are even now. Too bad your\Nmonster's effect is only temporary,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Once this turn is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk will have all of\Nhis power back Perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've still prevented you from\Nattacking me this turn, Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stalling for time is a sign of weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're obviously\Ndesperate. Now it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so stand back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I play two cards Both face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kaiba, but since I'm\Nnow holding three cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Slipers' attack points rise to 3,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that your turn is over,\NObelisk regains its full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So your monster is weaker again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe my face down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pot of Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the effect of this magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can now draw two more cards from my\Ndeck, and you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Slipper's attack points now rise\Nto 5,000 more than enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,take down your obelisk and wipe\Nout half your life points kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,now my dragon attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,hold on yuki now i\Nactivate command silencer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,my command silencer has deafened your sky\Ndragon with its extremely powerful shriek
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and since your monster couldn't hear your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,command i'm afraid your\Nattack is cancelled
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Out. Nice try. Next I\Nget to draw one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,from my deck now finish your move so i can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,end this My Egyptian\NGod card is still more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful than yours That may be the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're forgetting one thing. I have a\Ncard face down on the field. He's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and if that card's what I think it is\NIt can lower my Sliper's attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,making it weak enough to\Ndestroy What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk is losing his patience,\NYugi, so finish your move All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards face down\Non the field and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, feel free to attack me,\NKaiba. What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He just weakened his monster by\N2,000 points. What's wrong, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of my two face down cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has to attack now.\NIt's my move. Hold on, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Card destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we must both discard\Nevery card in our hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we must replenish our hands\Nwith the same number of cards. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't change the number\Nof cards in his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so his monster's attack\Npoints stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll reveal my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgraceful charity, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,now we must redraw the\Ncards we just threw out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me a grand total\Nof six cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know what happens now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My slipper gains 3,000\Npoints for a total of 6,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll have to do better\Nthan that to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that little stunt\Nyou just pulled with
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.67,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,your face down cards\Nhelped me out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,By giving me just the cards I\Nneeded to win this duel. Explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to you, I was\Nable to draw this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirst for compensation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It lets me summon two monsters\Nfrom my hand directly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Sword of Soul and Blade Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those monsters are too weak to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer automatically strikes\Nevery monster you summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Slifer, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Car Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can discard two cards from my hand,\Nwhich means Card Guard protects them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still too weak to be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,have you forgotten that\NObelisk has a special
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ability as well, and just\Nas soon as I activate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:09:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it you're finished just\Ntry it very well but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll regret those\Nwords i sacrifice my two
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters to trigger the\Nspecial ability of my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian god card are\Nyou aware of what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,now allow me to explain\Nyou fool these two New
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sacrifices allow Obelisk\Nto storm the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing 4,000 points of damage\Nto everything in its path!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I say everything, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that includes your life points, so\Nprepare to be wiped out! This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it can!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor, deplete\Nhis life points right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, destroy Yugi\Nand bring me victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My wall of Kuribos will protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop the wrath of Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, what's with the fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but let's hope\NYu-Gi's okay. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He better not have been on the\Nreceiving end of that blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, Yugi lost to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you expecting me to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that discarding Karibo\Nfrom my hand protects my life points?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibo, I would have lost\Nthis duel without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you defy the might of\NObelisk with that puny Karibo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down on the\Nfield, and that ends my turn. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kaiba, but since I've drawn a card,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sliper's attack points increased to 6,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper, destroy his obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Sinto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's life points are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, Yugi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You triggered my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Power balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my power balance trap, you have\Nto discard half of the cards in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:12:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you lose three cards,\NSlifer's attack points reduce by 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw out your three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As a secondary effect, I\Nget to draw three cards
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so it looks like my obelisk is\Nstronger than your slifer once again, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to return the favor Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,go obelisk, show Yugi\Nsome real power Hold on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Slifer's not going anywhere.\NI happen to have a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that will turn things around Now\NI activate my necromancy card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You may want to keep a\Nclose eye on your dual disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword of Soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all of my monsters\Nreturning to the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Necromancy restores four monsters\Nfrom your graveyard, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and they each return to\Nthe field in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, why would you waste your time giving\Nme more monsters to attack you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you asked, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My card has an unfortunate\Nside effect, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of these monsters are destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,my Necromancy will weaken your\Nremaining beasts by 600 points, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And since monsters have been\Nplayed on your side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,my Slyfer's special\Neffect has been triggered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Lightning Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Slifer destroyed\Nyour four new monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my Necromancy Magic Card weakens\Nyour one remaining monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So Obelisk loses 2,400 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I never thought you'd take such\Na cheap shot at my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The tables have turned once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and your monster's strength\Npales in comparison to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, destroy Obelisk now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what you've done by using your Egyptian\NGod card to destroy my Sword of Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows me to add 1,000 attack\Npoints to any monster I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose my Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I was able to\Nincrease Obelisk's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Obelisk, destroy his Slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian God card is ancient history!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Slifer should have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it would have been had I not stopped\NObelisk from attacking, Kaiba! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have you to thank\Nfor giving me the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect my Egyptian\NGod card from yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For that task was only possible\Nthanks to a trap card that you played.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When you activated your\Npower balance card,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to place three\Ncards in my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Including this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Recognize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a useful monster card\Nknown as Electromagnetic Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And it has quite a unique special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When this monster is\Nsent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it leaves a small electrode\Nattached to one of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case, Slifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And it lets you stop\Nour battle before Slifer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,was unlucky enough to\Ncollide with Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I see you did your homework, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I place this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This could take all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither Egyptian god\Ncard can be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is a whale of a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the duel I've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate battle\Nof intellect and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I duel against Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pushed to my limits and\Nchallenged in every possible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I defeated\Nhim in Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,he's known as the\Nworld's greatest duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But that title belongs to me, and\Nwhen I win the Battle City Tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore Yugi's reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,comes crumbling down at the\Nhands of my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi, my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, you only have\None card in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Slifer's\Nattack points are 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see you escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to show the world\Nthat I'm superior to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate his Slifer\Nwith your Fist of Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal the Magic Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Spell Textbook!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must discard every card in my hand,\Nand in exchange, I can draw one new card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can then play the card immediately,\Nbut only if I draw a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Slifer's attack points\Nare zero, you'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:18:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk, wipe out his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.15,0:18:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw the right card now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose to Kaiba and be\Neliminated from the tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help to save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate this magic card. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Card of Sanctity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.41,0:18:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It requires both of us to draw until\Neach one of us is holding six cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That means his Egyptian god\Ncard increases in strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Slifer has 6,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to lose this duel, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my final trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Life Shaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It shaves 2,000 attack points\Noff your Egyptian God card!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.93,0:19:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber Corp holograms\Naren't supposed to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the deal is,\Nbut this doesn't look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What could be going on, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The true power of Ancient Egypt\Nis beginning to reveal itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I fear for us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
